    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, borderTop: "3px solid #F59E0B", paddingTop: 22 }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "JetBrains Mono, monospace", lineHeight: 1 }}>21</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, marginTop: 14 }}>个内置工具</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>六个赛题场景全部覆盖，另有四个外部服务提供十三个工具，经同一张注册表并入模型工具集。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, borderTop: "3px solid #EF4444", paddingTop: 22 }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#EF4444", fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "JetBrains Mono, monospace", lineHeight: 1 }}>100%</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, marginTop: 14 }}>注入拦截率</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>四类注入特征全部命中，正常请求误拦为零。不可逆操作百分之百判红，不给确认通道。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 24, marginTop: 34, borderTop: "1px solid #243044", paddingTop: 22 }}>
