      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 6 }}>runtime 目录下执行测试命令，输出逐条用例名与通过状态。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.07)", border: "1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.3)", borderRadius: 10, padding: 18 }}>
